  "jcr:description": "The Darco Cannulated Compression screw system is a multi-size, multi-indication screw system designed specifically for the forefoot, midfoot, and hindfoot anatomy. All screws are designed to be self-drilling and self-tapping, and feature a reverse cutting flute for easy removal. With headed screw diameters ranging from 2.7mm to 7.5mm and a headless 7.0mm option, the Darco Cannulated Compression screw system offers multiple options to solve a variety of foot and ankle issues. Stryker | Wright Medical Technology",
